00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:54,380
 Yeah, well, I think my journey really started when I was in a corporate job.

113
00:06:54,720 --> 00:07:00,120
 I was stupid enough to leave a well-paid corporate role and sustain an AI company before the pandemic.

114
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:10,040
