 that we need the customer to have ready before we think they're going to buy are in place

142
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,460
 before we take them on.

143
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:16,300
 And then we basically, you know, try and manage our sales process, you know,

144
00:09:16,300 --> 00:09:19,700
 reflecting, you know, my own experience from being in a corporate.

145
