00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:09,180
 And we really started building this on the premise that large language models had some immutable

155
00:10:09,180 --> 00:10:10,180
 architectural limitations.

156
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:17,280
 So they will hallucinate, they're stochastic, so you can't audit how that decision has been made.

157
00:10:17,900 --> 00:10:23,380
 And we thought we were being very clever, coming up with this super reliable, you know,

158
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:28,520
 regulator-friendly AI that actually the FCA has just come out with, nothing to do with us,

