00:13:54,940 --> 00:14:04,420
 and then let your team decide how to enact that, and then what tools do you need that's

205
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:07,960
 going to deliver your bit of it whichever department you're in.

206
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:11,960
